# Packaged OpenRC user-service overrides -> /etc/user/conf.d/joetoo-kwind.
# The global /etc/conf.d/joetoo-kwind file sources this after its defaults.
# This root-managed file applies to all users, not just a specific account.
# No override is needed for the standard packaged executable.
# For a controlled development test, an administrator could set, e.g.:
# JOETOO_KWIND_EXEC="/home/joe/.local/libexec/joetoo-kwind"
